OL,3,ADeaf patient given wrong jab due to
OL,4,Asign language error, report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA deaf woman was given the wrong
OL,7,Fvaccine because she was not provided
OL,8,Fwith a British Sign Language (BSL)
OL,9,Finterpreter at her doctor's surgery, a
OL,10,Freport says.
OL,12,FThe Parliamentary and Health Service
OL,13,FOmbudsman (PHSO) said disabled people
OL,14,Fwere being let down by inaccessible
OL,15,Fcommunications.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
