OL,3,ADeaf patient given wrong jab due to
OL,4,Asign language error, report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the patient, Samantha, had
OL,7,Fbooked a flu jab but was instead given
OL,8,Fa Covid vaccine after staff failed to
OL,9,Fshow her a BSL video which would have
OL,10,Fhighlighted the error. She said the
OL,11,Fexperience had had a "profound impact"
OL,12,Fon her.
OL,14,FThe Department of Health and Social
OL,15,FCare said the "deeply upsetting
OL,16,Fstories" were "completely unacceptable"
OL,17,Fand NHS and social care organisations
OL,18,Fhad a duty to make services accessible.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
